{
  "$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DjobaDELATV/seygo_data/main/schema/v1/card.json",
  "id": "c35536ac-f5ff-4001-956a-118fa547dcdf",
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "name": "Djinn Demolisher of Rituals",
      "effect": "When you Ritual Summon a monster, you can banish this card from your Graveyard as 1 of the monsters required for the Ritual Summon. If a player Ritual Summons using this card, that Ritual Summoned monster cannot be targeted by the card effects of the other player."
    },
    "fr": {
      "name": "G\u00e9nie D\u00e9molisseur de Rituels",
      "effect": "Lorsque vous Invoquez Rituellement un monstre, vous pouvez bannir cette carte depuis votre Cimeti\u00e8re comme l'1 des monstres requis pour l'Invocation Rituelle. Si un joueur Invoque Rituellement en utilisant cette carte, le monstre Invoqu\u00e9 Rituellement ne peut pas \u00eatre cibl\u00e9 par des effets de carte de l'autre joueur."
    },
    "de": {
      "name": "Dschinn - Zerst\u00f6rer der Rituale",
      "effect": "Wenn du ein Monster als Ritualbeschw\u00f6rung beschw\u00f6rst, kannst du diese Karte als 1 der f\u00fcr die Ritualbeschw\u00f6rung ben\u00f6tigten Monster von deinem Friedhof verbannen. Falls ein Spieler ein Monster mit dieser Karte als Ritualbeschw\u00f6rung beschw\u00f6rt, kann das als Ritualbeschw\u00f6rung beschworene Monster nicht als Ziel f\u00fcr Karteneffekte des anderen Spielers gew\u00e4hlt werden."
    },
    "it": {
      "name": "Djinn Demolitore di Rituali",
      "effect": "Quando Evochi tramite Rituale un mostro, puoi bandire questa carta dal tuo Cimitero come 1 dei mostri richiesti per l'Evocazione Rituale. Se un giocatore Evoca tramite Rituale utilizzando questa carta, quel mostro Evocato tramite Rituale non pu\u00f2 essere scelto come bersaglio dagli effetti delle carte dell'altro giocatore."
    },
    "pt": {
      "name": "Djinn, o Demolidor de Rituais",
      "effect": "Quando voc\u00ea Invocar um monstro por Invoca\u00e7\u00e3o-Ritual, voc\u00ea pode banir este card do seu Cemit\u00e9rio como 1 dos monstros exigidos para a Invoca\u00e7\u00e3o-Ritual. Se um duelista Invocar por Invoca\u00e7\u00e3o-Ritual usando este card, esse monstro Invocado por Invoca\u00e7\u00e3o-Ritual n\u00e3o pode ser escolhido como alvo de efeitos de card do outro duelista."
    },
    "es": {
      "name": "Genio Demoledor de Rituales",
      "effect": "Cuando Invocas un monstruo por Ritual, puedes desterrar esta carta en tu Cementerio como 1 de los monstruos requeridos para la Invocaci\u00f3n por Ritual. Si un jugador Invoca por Ritual usando esta carta, ese monstruo Invocado por Ritual no puede ser seleccionado por los efectos de cartas del otro jugador."
    },
    "ja": {
      "name": "\u5100\u5f0f\u9b54\u4eba\u30c7\u30e2\u30ea\u30c3\u30b7\u30e3\u30fc",
      "effect": "\u2460\uff1a\u5100\u5f0f\u53ec\u559a\u3092\u884c\u3046\u5834\u5408\u3001\u305d\u306e\u5100\u5f0f\u53ec\u559a\u306b\u5fc5\u8981\u306a\u30ec\u30d9\u30eb\u5206\u306e\u30e2\u30f3\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\uff11\u4f53\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3001\u5893\u5730\u306e\u3053\u306e\u30ab\u30fc\u30c9\u3092\u9664\u5916\u3067\u304d\u308b\u3002\u2461\uff1a\u3053\u306e\u30ab\u30fc\u30c9\u3092\u4f7f\u7528\u3057\u3066\u5100\u5f0f\u53ec\u559a\u3057\u305f\u30e2\u30f3\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\u306f\u76f8\u624b\u306e\u52b9\u679c\u306e\u5bfe\u8c61\u306b\u306a\u3089\u306a\u3044\u3002"
    },
    "ko": {
      "name": "\uc758\uc2dd\ub9c8\uc778 \ub370\ubab0\ub9bf\uc154",
      "effect": "\u2460 : \uc758\uc2dd \uc18c\ud658\uc744 \uc2e4\ud589\ud560 \uacbd\uc6b0, \uadf8 \uc758\uc2dd \uc18c\ud658\uc5d0 \ud544\uc694\ud55c \ub808\ubca8\ub9cc\ud07c\uc758 \ubaac\uc2a4\ud130 1\uc7a5\uc73c\ub85c\uc11c, \ubb18\uc9c0\uc758 \uc774 \uce74\ub4dc\ub97c \uc81c\uc678\ud560 \uc218 \uc788\ub2e4. \u2461 : \uc774 \uce74\ub4dc\ub97c \uc0ac\uc6a9\ud558\uc5ec \uc758\uc2dd \uc18c\ud658\ud55c \ubaac\uc2a4\ud130\ub294 \uc0c1\ub300 \ud6a8\uacfc\uc758 \ub300\uc0c1\uc774 \ub418\uc9c0 \uc54a\ub294\ub2e4."
    }
